          "_name": "features13",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features12\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButton\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Items\" name=\"items\" min=\"1\" max=\"3\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Icon Size\" name=\"iconSize\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">        \n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#6592e6\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/bg-2.png\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#fafafa\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#000000\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">        \n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-12 schedule-header\">\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex item-heading\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">                        \n                        <span class=\"mbri-calendar\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5 date-schedule\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>&nbsp;VIETNAM EXCELLENCE® SUMMIT 2023</b></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-12 schedule-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">                                          \n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"><span><b>17:00</b></span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">                        \n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>“Game Changer” Exhibition &amp; Networking</b></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"><b>18:00</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">  \n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>&nbsp;“THE GAME CHANGER” Vietnam talent 2023 landscape</b><div><b><br></b></div></h5>\n                         <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">The Vietnamese economy faces many challenges in 2023, such as a low consumer confidence index and widespread layoffs. These challenges affect \n<br>not only the business performance but also the psychology and behavior of employees, even in well-performance companies. Companies need to be \n<br>creative and smart to overcome these challenges.<br></p>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">The report “THE GAME CHANGER” is a valuable resource for CEOs &amp; HRD who want to stay ahead of the curve in the talent market. It covers the latest trends and insights from the first half of 2023 and provides practical solutions to leverage your human capital, overcome challenges, and become \"The Real Game Changer\".</p>\n                        <div class=\"schedule-speakers mb-4\">\n                            <div class=\"speaker-title\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>Speaker</b></p>\n                            </div>\n                            <ul class=\"speaker-list\">\n                                <li>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-img\">\n                                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/thanh-nguyen.jpg\" alt=\"Thanh Nguyễn\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-detail\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Ms. <b>THANH NGUYEN</b><br><i>Chief Happiness Officer</i><i style=\"font-size: 0.8rem;\">&nbsp;Anphabe&nbsp;</i></h4>\n                                    </div>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                           \n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex  item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\"><b>18:45</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">                        \n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>AnphaTalk<br>ADVANCING YOUR ADVANTAGE IN TALENT ACQUISITION</b></h5>   \n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">7 predictions from LinkedIn, the world's largest career community network, about the future of recruiting and strategic shifts in talent acquisition and \n<br>retention</p>                         \n                        <div class=\"schedule-speakers mb-4\">\n                            <div class=\"speaker-title\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>Speaker</b></p>\n                            </div>\n                            <ul class=\"speaker-list\">\n                                <li>      \n                                    <div class=\"speaker-img\">\n                                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/eddy.png\" alt=\"Céline Nhã Nguyễn\">\n                                    </div>                              \n                                    <div class=\"speaker-detail\">\n                                        \n                                        <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Mr. <b>EDDYMAN KHARMA&nbsp;</b><br><i>Regional Channel Partner Manager \n</i><div><i>LinkedIn</i></div></h4>\n                                    </div>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">                        \n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\"><b>19:00</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                     <div class=\"text-box\">                        \n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>Vietnam Excellence® 2023 Ceremony</b></h5>       \n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".list\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li><b>HR EXCELLENCE® 2023</b></li>\n                            <li><b>&nbsp;LEADERSHIP EXCELLENCE™ 2023&nbsp;</b></li>\n                        </ul>  \n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Honoring Leaders &amp; Organizations with excellent success in transforming business through talent &amp; workplace development, who will also serve as role \n<br>models for our business community. To honor Leaders &amp; Organizations with excellent success in transforming business through talent &amp; workplace \n<br>development. In return, they will also serve as role models for our business community.&nbsp;</p>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">We are honored to have an esteemed Advisory Board that recognizes and connects you with Excellence Leaders and Excellence HR Teams who share&nbsp;their best practices and help you adapt them to your business.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                \n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">                        \n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\"><b>19:30</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">                        \n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>Celebration Party</b></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">        \n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\"><b>20:00</b></p>\n                    </div>                    \n                    <div class=\"text-box\">                        \n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>Panel discussion</b><br><b>EMPLOYEES CARE: “GAME CHANGING” APPROACHES&nbsp;</b></h5>  \n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Employee care is a vital factor for the success of any business. Therefore, by improving skills and knowledge on providing the best care and support to staff, we can enhance the employee experience and engagement, which are the key drivers of our performance and growth.</p>                      \n                        <div class=\"schedule-speakers mb-4\">\n                            <div class=\"speaker-title\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    <b>Speakers</b></p>\n                            </div>\n                            <ul class=\"speaker-list\">\n                                <li>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-img\">\n                                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/phu-xuan.jpg\" alt=\"Phú Xuân\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-detail\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                            Bà <b style>TRẦN HOÀNG PHÚ XUÂN</b><br><i>Founder &amp; CEO Faslink Group</i><div><i style=\"font-size: 0.8rem;\">Vice Chairman of Association of</i></div><div><i style=\"font-size: 0.8rem;\">Textile – Garment – Embroidery – Knitting HCMC</i></div></h4>\n                                    </div>\n                                </li>\n                                <li>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-img\">\n                                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/thu-hoa.jpg\" alt=\"Thu Hòa\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-detail\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Ms.&nbsp;<b>NGUYỄN THỊ THU HÒA</b><br><i>CEO - ADP Group</i></h4>\n                                    </div>\n                                </li>\n                                <li>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-img\">\n                                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/nguyenanhhung.jpg\" alt=\"Nguyen Anh Hung\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"speaker-detail\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Mr. <b>NGUYEN ANH HUNG</b><br><i>Founder, CEO - CBVGroup</i><br><i>Senior CEO’s Advisor – PNJ Group</i></h4>\n                                    </div>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                           \n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div> \n\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\"><b>20:30</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>Celebration Photoshoot&nbsp;</b></h5>                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex item-border\">\n                    <div class=\"time-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7 time-slot\"><b>21:00</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\"><b>Farewell &amp; Door gift</b></h5>                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>        \n    </div>\n</section>",
